<title id="orbit-title">How orbit works</title>
<desc id="orbit-desc">The International Space Station is at the top of a circular orbit. Its forward motion points right along the tangent. Gravity points downward toward Earth's center. The ISS, its crew, and objects inside fall around Earth together. Schematic, not to scale.</desc>
